   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A possibility",
     "texto": [
      "To say that something may happen, without being sure, use **-(으)ㄹ지도 모르다**: 가다 → **갈지도 몰라요** (it may be that (he/she) goes), 먹다 → **먹을지도 몰라요** (it may be that (he/she) eats), 맛있다 → **맛있을지도 몰라요** (it may be that it is tasty).",
      "비가 **올지도 몰라요** = it may be that it rains."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With 혹시",
     "texto": [
      "**혹시** (perhaps, just in case) usually goes first. It then sounds like a precaution: 혹시 **모르니까요** = just in case.",
      "Use it to point out a possibility: 혹시 늦을지도 몰라요 = perhaps I'll be late."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
